{
    "title": "FiMe: Find Phone By Clap Hand",
    "description": "\ud83d\udc4f Clap to Find Your Phone: Misplaced your phone again? Worry no more! FiMe revolutionizes the way you locate your device. Simply clap your hands, and your phone will respond with a ringtone, even when it's silent! This feature is perfect for those moments when you can't remember where you left your phone.\r\n\ud83d\udd0a Pocket Mode Alert: Ever had your phone ring at the wrong time? Our Pocket Mode Alert ensures that your phone stays silent when it's in your pocket, avoiding any awkward or disruptive moments. It automatically detects when the phone is in a confined space and silences notifications, allowing you to stay focused and undisturbed.\r\n\ud83c\udf53 Sound collection: You can freely choose the phone alarm sound from the list. Interesting sounds like cat meowing, rooster crowing, doorbell ringing... Clap your hands and wait for the phone to \"answer\"\r\n\ud83d\udc4f Find your lost phone easily and quickly with the help of this application. The FiMe app is designed to help you locate your device easily, whether you're in a crowded area, in the dark, or somewhere indoors.\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 Convenience your life with the clap detection feature: Imagine your phone always at hand, you can find it at any time. With the FiMe app, you can easily and effectively detect your phone, ensuring that it won't get lost.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc4f How to use FiMe:\r\n1. Start the application\r\n2. Click the Activate button\r\n3. It will detect clapping sound when you are looking for your phone.\r\n4. The FiMe app will respond to your clapping and whistling sounds.\r\n5. It will distinguish and recognize the clapping sound and start ringing, flashing or vibrating.\r\n\r\nWhy should you install the FiMe application?\r\n- Easy to Use: Both features are designed with user-friendliness in mind. Activate them with just a few taps, and customize settings to suit your preferences.\r\n- Privacy Assured: We value your privacy. FiMe doesn't require unnecessary permissions and ensures your data remains secure.\r\n- Perfect for Everyone: Whether you're a busy professional, a student, or just someone who frequently misplaces their phone, FiMe is the perfect solution for a hassle-free life.\r\n- Activate the flash to find your phone in the dark\r\n\r\nDownload FiMe now and transform your phone-finding experience. Say goodbye to the panic of lost phones and hello to peace of mind!\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions, suggestions or feedback, please don't hesitate to contact us at support@godhitech.com. Thank you for your support!!!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83d\udc4f Clap to Find Your Phone: Misplaced your phone again? Worry no more! FiMe revolutionizes the way you locate your device. Simply clap your hands, and your phone will respond with a ringtone, even when it&#39;s silent! This feature is perfect for those moments when you can&#39;t remember where you left your phone.<br>\ud83d\udd0a Pocket Mode Alert: Ever had your phone ring at the wrong time? Our Pocket Mode Alert ensures that your phone stays silent when it&#39;s in your pocket, avoiding any awkward or disruptive moments. It automatically detects when the phone is in a confined space and silences notifications, allowing you to stay focused and undisturbed.<br>\ud83c\udf53 Sound collection: You can freely choose the phone alarm sound from the list. Interesting sounds like cat meowing, rooster crowing, doorbell ringing... Clap your hands and wait for the phone to &quot;answer&quot;<br>\ud83d\udc4f Find your lost phone easily and quickly with the help of this application. The FiMe app is designed to help you locate your device easily, whether you&#39;re in a crowded area, in the dark, or somewhere indoors.<br>\ud83c\udfb5 Convenience your life with the clap detection feature: Imagine your phone always at hand, you can find it at any time. With the FiMe app, you can easily and effectively detect your phone, ensuring that it won&#39;t get lost.<br><br>\ud83d\udc4f How to use FiMe:<br>1. Start the application<br>2. Click the Activate button<br>3. It will detect clapping sound when you are looking for your phone.<br>4. The FiMe app will respond to your clapping and whistling sounds.<br>5. It will distinguish and recognize the clapping sound and start ringing, flashing or vibrating.<br><br>Why should you install the FiMe application?<br>- Easy to Use: Both features are designed with user-friendliness in mind. Activate them with just a few taps, and customize settings to suit your preferences.<br>- Privacy Assured: We value your privacy. FiMe doesn&#39;t require unnecessary permissions and ensures your data remains secure.<br>- Perfect for Everyone: Whether you&#39;re a busy professional, a student, or just someone who frequently misplaces their phone, FiMe is the perfect solution for a hassle-free life.<br>- Activate the flash to find your phone in the dark<br><br>Download FiMe now and transform your phone-finding experience. Say goodbye to the panic of lost phones and hello to peace of mind!<br><br>If you have any questions, suggestions or feedback, please don&#39;t hesitate to contact us at support@godhitech.com. Thank you for your support!!!",
